    "original": "「梅酒ってどうやって作るの？作るの難しい？」「難しくないよ。青梅とホワイトリカー、あと氷砂糖があればできるよ。氷砂糖のかわりに蜂蜜入れても美味しいよ」",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "10127026",
        "text": "\"How is plum wine made? Is it difficult to make?\" \"It isn't that hard. You combine unripe plums and white liquor, then add some rock sugar if you have some. Even if you substitute the sugar for honey, it's still delicious.\""
